 interested in recruiting PMs.", "section": "Conferences", "repo": "dend/awesome-product-management"}, {"name": "La Product Conf", "url": "https://www.laproductconf.com/", "desc": "Organized by Thiga, La Product Conf (LPC) takes place once a year with events in Paris (France) and Madrid (Spain). The speaker lineup features product leaders from Pinterest, Carrefour, Payfit, Google, Meetic and more.", "section": "Conferences", "repo": "dend/awesome-product-management"}, {"name": "Stratechery by Ben Thompson", "url": "https://stratechery.com/", "desc": "Product and strategy insights from the industry.", "section": "Additional resources", "repo": "dend/awesome-product-management"}, {"name": "Mobbin", "url": "https://mobbin.design/", "desc": "Hand-picked collection of mobile app design patterns.", "section": "Additional resources", "repo": "dend/awesome-product-management"}, {"name": "Marketing for Engineers", "url": "https://github.com/goabstract/Marketing-for-Engineers", "desc": "A handy guide on growing marketing skills for folks with engineering backgrounds.", "section": "Additional resources", "repo": "dend/awesome-product-management"}]}